{"seq":1,"slug":"market-microstructure","title":"市场微观结构","stage":"DONE","category":"quantitative-finance","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure","rating":{"composite":3.77,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.38,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 市场微观结构\n\n市场微观结构（Market Microstructure）是金融学的重要分支，研究证券交易的具体过程和机制如何影响价格形成、流动性供给以及市场效率。与传统金融理论假设的\"无摩擦市场\"不同，微观结构理论深入考察真实交易中的信息不对称、订单流动态、交易成本和市场参与者行为。\n\n这一领域的核心问题包括：价格如何从分散的买卖订单中涌现？流动性如何被创造和消耗？信息如何通过交易活动融入价格？不同的市场结构设计如何影响交易质量？随着电子化交易和算法交易的普及，这些问题在实践中变得更加重要。\n\n本 Hub 从四个维度系统梳理市场微观结构的知识体系：\n\n- **市场结构基础**：交易所运行机制、市场参与者生态、市场质量度量指标\n- **价格形成机制**：订单簿动态与价格发现、买卖价差建模、市场冲击与最优执行\n- **高频交易**：HFT 策略分类、低延迟基础设施、监管框架与市场公平\n- **现代微观结构**：暗池与另类交易系统、加密货币市场结构、市场碎片化与最佳执行\n\n从 Kyle（1985）和 Glosten-Milgrom（1985）奠定的经典信息模型，到 2020 年代的深度学习订单流预测和去中心化交易所（DEX）做市机制，市场微观结构始终是连接金融理论与交易实践的桥梁。对量化交易者、做市商、监管机构和交易所设计者而言，理解微观结构是制定有效策略和政策的基础。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"market-structure","title":"市场结构基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure/market-structure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"exchange-mechanics","title":"交易所运行机制与订单类型","url":"/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure/market-structure/exchange-mechanics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"market-participants","title":"市场参与者与生态系统","url":"/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure/market-structure/market-participants"},{"seq":3,"slug":"market-quality-metrics","title":"市场质量度量：流动性、波动性与效率","url":"/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure/market-structure/market-quality-metrics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"price-formation","title":"价格形成机制","docCount":3,"url":"/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure/price-formation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"order-book-dynamics","title":"订单簿动态与价格发现","url":"/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure/price-formation/order-book-dynamics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bid-ask-spread","title":"买卖价差模型与信息不对称","url":"/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure/price-formation/bid-ask-spread"},{"seq":3,"slug":"market-impact-models","title":"市场冲击模型与最优执行","url":"/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure/price-formation/market-impact-models"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"high-frequency","title":"高频交易","docCount":3,"url":"/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure/high-frequency","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hft-strategies","title":"高频交易策略分类","url":"/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure/high-frequency/hft-strategies"},{"seq":2,"slug":"latency-infrastructure","title":"低延迟基础设施与技术架构","url":"/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure/high-frequency/latency-infrastructure"},{"seq":3,"slug":"hft-regulation","title":"高频交易监管与市场公平","url":"/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure/high-frequency/hft-regulation"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"modern-microstructure","title":"现代微观结构","docCount":3,"url":"/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure/modern-microstructure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dark-pools","title":"暗池与另类交易系统","url":"/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure/modern-microstructure/dark-pools"},{"seq":2,"slug":"crypto-microstructure","title":"加密货币市场微观结构","url":"/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure/modern-microstructure/crypto-microstructure"},{"seq":3,"slug":"market-fragmentation","title":"市场碎片化与最佳执行","url":"/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure/modern-microstructure/market-fragmentation"}]}]}